yss</a> - guardian <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/monsters/drowned-king\">Drowned King</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/w/overrank/dungeons/ice-cave\">Frozen Cavern</a> - guardian <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/monsters/frost-matriarch\">Frost Matriarch</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/w/overrank/dungeons/swamp\">Drowned Marsh</a> - guardian <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/monsters/rotwood-behemoth\">Rotwood Behemoth</a></li> </ul>"}]}, {"id": "rewards", "heading": "Rewards", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "Clearing the rift pays 40 shards and the XP of the rank, one prize from the guardian spoils per awakened who fought the guardian, and the chests: chest tiers of a rank E dungeon .", "html": "<p>Clearing the rift pays <strong>40 shards</strong> and the XP of the rank, one prize from the <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/odds#guardian-spoils\">guardian spoils</a> per awakened who fought the guardian, and the chests: <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/odds#rift-chest\">chest tiers of a rank E dungeon</a>.</p>"}]}, {"id": "good-to-know", "heading": "Good to know", "blocks": [{"type": "ul", "text": "1 side branch(es), 0 loops, 0 dead ends elite chance 10% lives 5 chest shards 8-14", "html": "<ul> <li>1 side branch(es), 0 loops, 0 dead ends</li> <li>elite chance 10%</li> <li>lives 5</li> <li>chest shards 8-14</li> </ul>"}]}], "media": [], "related": [{"text": "Rank Nation rift", "href": "/en/w/overrank/rifts/rift-nation", "img": "/games/overrank/rifts/undiscovered-512.webp"}, {"text": "Disguised Nation rift", "href": "/en/w/overrank/rifts/disguised-nation-rift", "img": "/games/overrank/rifts/undiscovered-512.webp"}, {"text": "Double dungeon", "href": "/en/w/overrank/rifts/double-dungeon", "img": "/games/overrank/rifts/undiscovered-512.webp"}, {"text": "Nested rift", "href": "/en/w/overrank/rifts/nested-rift", "img": "/games/overrank/rifts/undiscovered-512.webp"}], "toc": [{"id": "overview", "text": "Overview"}, {"id": "strength-and-rewards", "text": "Strength and rewards"}, {"id": "where-it-opens", "text": "Where it